\"strong\">Jacob</span>:  The humanities department is having a party on Saturday. Do you want to come?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I might go. Thanks!", "id": 2, "time": "13000", "image": "engenn5le10ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jacob</span>:  I may take a futurology course next term.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Futurology? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jacob</span>: Yeah, it's the study of predicting the future. We ask questions like: will technology make our lives better? Will we have a world government?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: My question is: Will this course ever be over?", "id": 3, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn5le10ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}